title: "University Courses (UC): Evrensel Akademik İşletim Sistemi & Solopreneur Bilgi Mimarisi"
abstract: "A high-density open-source universal academic operating system and knowledge architecture covering 374 academic disciplines across 21 containers with a standardized 7-tier protocol (00-06), 2,618 curriculum modules, 20 cutting-edge research monographs, polymathic mental models, and an automated CLI search indexer."
